# Controller & ROG Ally Standards

## Playtester Focus
- Dedicated agent role for mobile PC gameplay testing.
- Ensure full playability with keyboard + controller (default for Asus ROG Ally).
- Test all menus, movement (8-way thumbstick), command grid (BACK button), remapping.
- Validate intuitive UX for couch/controller-first experience.
- Test with physical ROG Ally or equivalent (Xbox-like layout, shoulder buttons, thumbsticks).

## Input Mapping
- Extend existing controller.c, controller_menu.c, controller_config_menu.c.
- Default mappings optimized for ROG Ally (A/B/X/Y, D-Pad, LB/RB, Start/Back).
- Support key repeat, diagonal movement, simultaneous keyboard fallback.
- Persistent configs in lib/user/controller.prf.
- Comprehensive unit tests in src/tests/test_controller.c.

## Verification
- Run playtesting after every input/UI change.
- Verify Steam overlay compatibility if applicable.
- Document any ROG Ally specific quirks or optimizations.

Use alongside steamband-core.mdc.
